	"Description": "Item Auto Stacker\n\nPress the activation key (by default k, can be changed by editing config.json), and all the items in your inventory will be stacked together into as few stacks as possible. _It won't stack unstackable items or stack things over the maximum stack limit._\n\nRequires[SMAPI v2.9.0+](https://smapi.io).\n\n[Check out my other mods by clicking here!](https://www.nexusmods.com/users/44734342?tab=user+files)",
